{
  "about": "The NFC tag's address, given in the tag applet's install parameters (GlobalPlatform C9): the whole address in ASCII, 9 to 127 bytes, beginning https://, the byte after it a letter or a digit, every byte 21 to 7E but none of \" # < > \\ ^ ` { | }. `hex` is the install parameters' bytes exactly. For a valid address, `cc` is the capability container (file E103), `ndefNew` the NDEF file (E104) of a card with no owner or no holder's record, and `ndefCodedSize` the size of the NDEF file of a set-up card. Every invalid address is refused at install and no tag is made. spec/APDU.md, The NFC tag.",
